# The assistant tab's chat endpoint.
#
# Was /assistant/chat, proxied by nginx to a RAG service on :8001 -- a service
# that is not in this repo, has no unit in scripts/deploy.sh, and had no nginx
# location either. The request fell through to the SPA catch-all, so the tab
# got index.html with a 200, res.ok was true, and every question the fast path
# missed died on JSON.parse while the status pill read "Ready".
#
# It is now a route on the app itself, under /api/v1, which nginx already
# proxies and the session cookie already guards. Empty or absent, the tab says
# "Not connected" rather than posting questions into the dark.
VITE_ASSISTANT_URL=/api/v1/assistant/chat
